.godot/
artifacts/
/build/
# [P24]'s Steam export writes the Linux and Windows builds here — 272 MB of
# binaries that are rebuilt from source by definition. export_presets.cfg is
# the part worth keeping; its output is not.
/dist/
# Godot only reads export presets from the project root, so [P24] copies its
# master there at export time (game/ui/meta/export_build.gd:25). The master is
# game/content/meta/export_presets.cfg and is tracked; this is its footprint.
/export_presets.cfg
*.import
__pycache__/
